<div class="card" style="max-width: 500px; margin: 2rem auto; text-align: center;">
  <h2>Welcome to <%= appName %></h2>
  <p style="margin: 1.5rem 0; color: #718096;">
    Please login to continue. You will be redirected to the Auth Provider for authentication.
  </p>
  
  <a href="/auth/login" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 0.75rem 2rem; font-size: 1rem;">
    Login with SSO
  </a>
  
  <p class="note" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
    Your identity will be verified through the centralized Auth Provider.
    No credentials are stored in this application.
  </p>
</div>
